<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαρδάπτω</span></b> , aor.
		subj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαρδάψῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.628
				</span></i>
			; inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαρδάψαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδάρδαφα,</span>
				Id.:—<i>devour,</i> of wild beasts, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.479
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτήματα, χρήματα
				δαρδάπτουσιν,</span>
			<i>they devour</i> one's patrimony, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.315
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				711
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. με πόθος Εὐριπίδου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					66
				</span></i>
			: in late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nec.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. (Perh. dissim. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρ-δ</span>ṛ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτω</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρέπω.</span>)</div>
